# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data. ~3.6 GB of acquired atlases + one dangling symlink to the LaCie.
# All of it is regenerable from the commands in data/README.md, which IS
# tracked. Nothing under data/ is committed except that log and the small
# derived spike outputs whitelisted below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/README.md

# Phase 0 spike outputs: ~1.6 MB of derived parquet. Tracked so the reported
# AUROCs can be re-checked without re-downloading 3.6 GB of source atlases.
!data/spike/
data/spike/**
!data/spike/*.parquet
!data/spike/*.json
!data/spike/hoffman2/
!data/spike/hoffman2/*.parquet

# Never commit source atlases even if a path above is loosened.
*.tsv.gz
*.txt.gz
*.pdb
eve_bulk.zip

# Local Claude Code state (machine-specific permissions, not project config)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# Cluster job output
*.o[0-9]*
*.e[0-9]*
*.po[0-9]*
*.pe[0-9]*

# macOS
.DS_Store
